OL,3,GNorth West
OL,4,
OL,5,CToday:FA dry and bright start but
OL,6,Fturning increasing cloudy from mid-
OL,7,Fmorning with outbreaks of heavy rain
OL,8,Freaching the region and persisting
OL,9,Fduring much of the day. Turning
OL,10,Fsomewhat brighter across the south of
OL,11,Fthe region later.
OL,12,
OL,13,CTonight:FOutbreaks of rain, locally
OL,14,Fheavy will continue to move slowly
OL,15,Fnorthwards across the region. This
OL,16,Fwill turn light and patchy later in
OL,17,Fthe night as it clears from the south.
OL,23,QppppppppppppppppppppGSource: Met Office
OL,24,ANext Page  BWeather  CReg News  FReg TV
